From 436bd2bcd368ed68f1a1c7ed799d1903c68c11f8 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Harrison Bowden <hbowden@jaguarlandrover.com>
Date: Wed, 12 Aug 2026 15:39:37 -0700
Subject: [PATCH 4/4] fix: resolve setModifier infinite recursion and unknown
 effect type crash

Modifier fix (SquooshRoot/Render/TreeBuilder):
- Replace sub-SquooshRoot approach for modifier-wrap nodes with inline
  squooshRender using a Spacer composable, eliminating recursive re-entry
- Add skipRootChildRender parameter to squooshRender so the root node's
  child-render branch is skipped when already rendering as a composable
- Remove renderSubtree field and isModifierWrapComponent plumbing that
  drove the old recursive sub-SquooshRoot path

Unknown effect type (figma_schema/transform_flexbox):
- Add serde(other) Unknown variant to EffectType enum so documents with
  unrecognized effects (e.g. NOISE) deserialize without crashing
- Handle Unknown variant in transform_flexbox with a warning log
